        "Sanctions": "04/10/00GS: NFA REPORT OF QUARTERLY ACTIONS, THIRD QUARTER 1999, VOLUME XI, ISSUE 3, PAGE 2, DISCLOSES: ON SEPTEMBER 14, 1999, NFA'S BUSINESS CONDUCT COMMITTEE ISSUED A DECISION BASED UPON SETTLEMENT AN OFFER SUBMITTED BY MARK E. REHN (REHN). THE DECISION ORDERED REHN TO PERMANENTLY WITHDRAW FROM NFA MEMBERSHIP AND ASSOCIATE MEMBERSHIP. REHN WAS ALSO ORDERED NOT TO ACT AS A PRINCIPAL OF AN NFA MEMBER. REHN NEITHER ADMITTED NOR DENIED THE ALLEGATIONS IN THE COMPLAINT. THE FIRM WAS A FUTURES COMMISSION MERCHANT NFA MEMBER LOCATED IN CHICAGO, ILLINOIS. REHN IS A FORMER ASSOCIATED PERSON OF THE FIRM. THE DECISION BECAME EFFECTIVE ON SEPTEMBER 29, 1999.",
